#  /////////////////////// @AuditCategorySetup
  @AuditCategorySetup @Create
  Scenario: User Should be able to add it in AMC
    Given User navigates to 'lattice.url' page
    When User is at home screen after login with "username" and "password"
    When User clicks on 'Audit & Inspections Management' in navigation panel
    And User clicks on 'Audit Category Setup' in sidebar menu
    And User clicks on button 'Create Audit Category'
    And User select the '' ACS Audit Master Category dropdown
    And User Enters ACS Audit Category Name
    And User select the '' ACS Enforcing Authority dropdown
    And User select the '' ACS Industry Standard Description dropdown
    And User select the '' ACS Legal Requirements dropdown
    And User Enters Sampling Location and Asset Percentage
    And User select the '' ACS Work Order dropdown
    And User checks the Active check box in Create ACS
    When User clicking on Save Button in Schedules
    Then User verifies Audit Category Setup details in table

