    And User select the '' Audit Master Category dropdown
    And User select the '' Audit Category dropdown
    Then User verify the Schedule Name details
    And User select the '' Client dropdown
    And User select the '' Client Category dropdown
    And User select the '' Property dropdown
    And User selects Check All for Applicable Zones
    And User select the '' Primary Auditee dropdown
    When User select the '' Schedule Start Date
    When User select the '' Schedule End Date
    And User select the '' Frequency dropdown
    And User select the '' Audit Company Type dropdown
    And User select the '' Auditor Designation dropdown
    When User clicking on Save Button in Schedules
    Then User verifies added Audit Schedule details in table

